  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">A test fails on origin/master: send-as-user from the own mailbox with ArchiveOutgoingOptIn false does not archive and returns the same archivalWarning as the app-only path.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Opt-in true or no account row still archives; an account read failure still archives with the warning log; FromMailbox sends unchanged; app-only path unchanged.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Build, filtered tests (Communication) and full ArchTests pass; publish-size delta reported.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>
