  <completion>Done 2026-11-25: PR #3117 squash-merged to master (6edbd0d369, Closes #2672) after a main-session review. A send-as-user request reads the archive opt-in from FromMailbox or, when absent, the caller's own mailbox (token email), so a user who opted out is not archived when sending from their own mailbox; publish +88 B. Follow-up DI-173 #3119 (opt-in read from the client-supplied FromMailbox) is an owner decision. Reaches dev with the next uac-r2 dev BFF build.</completion>
